## Human authorization

The project authorizes a broad primary-source literature study and the
definition of an explicitly labeled project intermediate renormalization
scheme.

The bare action is not claimed to determine the finite parts.

A project scheme is lawful only when:

```text
four independent conditions exist;
the exact C117 operator basis is closed;
the conditions preserve authenticated symmetries and ownership;
the finite-C43 adapter is explicit;
a conversion or matching path to a standard or physical scheme exists;
scheme dependence is retained as a systematic;
and no unknown coefficient is set to zero for convenience.
```

## Mission

Determine whether the C117 blocker can be replaced by a complete
renormalization-design authority.

Do not calculate or select the four physical coefficients in C259.

