Do not call intermediate-scheme targets physical.

## Phase 6 — finite-C43 matching architecture

Publish the planned affine system:

\[
M^{(K)}(\mu,\mathcal S)c^{(K)}
=
t^{\mathcal S}(\mu)-r^{(K)}(\mu,\mathcal S)
\]

for K9/K11/K13.

Define every required adapter:

```text
