off-shell momentum to finite-cell wavepacket;
continuum transverse momentum to HO basis;
operator/source normalization;
gauge and BRST convention;
Abel-regulator topology;
boundary/link/holonomy scope;
and standard-scheme conversion.
```

Do not evaluate coefficients yet.

## Phase 7 — plan selection

Select exactly one:

```text
C117RENORMDESIGN1-A:
PROJECT_C117_RI_SMOM_V1 full-rank design ready;

C117RENORMDESIGN1-B:
Ward/RI-SMOM hybrid full-rank design ready;

C117RENORMDESIGN1-C:
